<title>UK: World Bank sets $1 bln September 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $1 bln September 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by co-lead managers Yamaichi International (Europe) and Yamaichi International (America).</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $1 BLN	  COUPON     5.68 PCT  MATURITY    27 SEP 99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.13     PAY DATE    26 SEP.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	Long first coupon to March 27, 1997</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    None	PAY FREQ    SEMI ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	Issued under a global multi-currency programme</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
